1
00:00:09,583 --> 00:00:11,875
Is there anything you're still unsure about?

2
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:13,625
Who knows if any
of this is real.

3
00:00:13,625 --> 00:00:16,291
Maybe you hired all these
people to act for you.

4
00:00:16,291 --> 00:00:17,000
Idiot!

5
00:00:17,000 --> 00:00:18,833
I once saw a mysterious crystal star

6
00:00:18,833 --> 00:00:20,125
a ring in Persia.

7
00:00:20,125 --> 00:00:22,291
Its radiance is unmistakable.

8
00:00:22,291 --> 00:00:26,583
I swear on my name. This ring is the genuine article!

9
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:34,083
Lord Severin, the lords from
every region of Golantis have arrived.

10
00:00:34,083 --> 00:00:36,250
They await your command outside.

11
00:00:36,250 --> 00:00:37,375
Let them in.

12
00:00:37,375 --> 00:00:41,500
By Lord Severin's command, let them through!

13
00:00:41,916 --> 00:00:43,125
What?

14
00:00:43,125 --> 00:00:45,250
Heads of state from other kingdoms?

15
00:00:45,250 --> 00:00:47,583
Could he actually be the Godfather?

16
00:00:49,708 --> 00:00:51,000
Make way!

17
00:00:57,625 --> 00:00:58,791
Godfather!

18
00:00:58,791 --> 00:01:01,791
Congratulations on your wedding, my lord!

19
00:01:10,750 --> 00:01:12,750
The King has arrived!

20
00:01:17,125 --> 00:01:19,291
- Your Majesty!
- Your Majesty!

21
00:01:19,291 --> 00:01:22,750
Today is the Godfather’s wedding day.

22
00:01:22,750 --> 00:01:24,000
Everyone rise.

23
00:01:36,125 --> 00:01:37,333
Godfather.

24
00:01:37,791 --> 00:01:40,333
Congratulations on your wedding, my lord.

25
00:01:40,333 --> 00:01:42,333
No need for formalities.Take your seat.

26
00:01:42,333 --> 00:01:44,875
I have some private
matters to settle first.

27
00:01:50,416 --> 00:01:56,375
On such a joyous day,
what private matter requires your attention?

28
00:01:56,375 --> 00:02:00,916
Many people here think I’m
an impostor and want me executed.

29
00:02:00,916 --> 00:02:04,541
You are the nominal
ruler of this continent.

30
00:02:04,541 --> 00:02:05,625
Bear witness.

31
00:02:06,250 --> 00:02:07,458
What?!

32
00:02:07,458 --> 00:02:10,500
Lord Severin may
keep a low profile,

33
00:02:10,500 --> 00:02:14,125
but he has saved Golantis
from disaster time and again.

34
00:02:14,125 --> 00:02:18,208
Who dares question the Godfather’s identity?
